cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use runward or reference its OSCAL mapping, please cite it as below."
title: runward
abstract: >-
  A delivery framework for agentic systems: floor first, evolution on
  evidence, governance from day zero, handover with proof. The Forward
  Deployed Engineer method, made executable, with a deterministic,
  read-only, zero-LLM conformance gate. Gate-level machine-readable audit
  evidence (OSCAL component-definition) is derived from traced decisions;
  the mapping is specified in docs/spec/runward-oscal-mapping.md
  (spec version 1.0).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Souris
    given-names: Thibault
repository-code: "https://github.com/stranxik/runward"
url: "https://runward.dev"
license: MIT
version: "0.20.0"
date-released: "2026-07-16"
keywords:
  - agentic
  - ai-agents
  - governance
  - delivery
  - architecture
  - OSCAL
  - audit-evidence
